4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=14MrItLVrI0Q7kNvwExo-mQ&_nc_oc=Adp2BQDjjEDKvFIAJiTT02AOtFeZkWwPzGbd43E-KVPxcN5I5nRNmO0bX9am5xQ8tvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTx6tbq-AHwFnp7qRQwXlzIgJueN6A3lU99AeAoQL8x9w&oe=6AEF5A14"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lgMBzVFoJ2sQ7kNvwG51szq&_nc_oc=AdrE3xI64pWbYnFixXGvuV1T42RUVqo6tJyNo3FjUTOzSvRoFOaqocn3Y9EZuAKtyBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYiLOluHdcGL2yn7zvxW7o73k9I-SWFKMeL2qVngEzDA&oe=6AEF5EF2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5fDXtGOc0r8Q7kNvwFwKjBM&_nc_oc=AdoEB5TfGr9JKGyRU6yiNwwvBfpoCaKV00f3-1GVTP4qMhAyaPBIWprnO1COEZVgVxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRASx2vcnxKj5legtKqLTix50AXOZK4FS31Qcu3smtcgQ&oe=6AEF3455"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p